{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02539",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 3.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "hello, doctor may I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.13,
      "end_seconds": 10.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "So, not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.96,
      "end_seconds": 15.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Well, I've been having periods becoming irregular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.71,
      "end_seconds": 21.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.66,
      "end_seconds": 35.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.36,
      "end_seconds": 67.91,
      "duration_seconds": 14.55,
      "text": "Okay: height 180 centimetres, pressure 119 over 70. And temperature 36.6, saturation 98 percent, weight 86 kilos, BMI works out to 26.5, pulse is 64 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.56,
      "end_seconds": 70.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.16,
      "end_seconds": 81.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second. Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.04,
      "end_seconds": 94.05,
      "duration_seconds": 12.01,
      "text": "I've had it for two days. I've had poor sleep too, for about a month. There was mood swings, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.84,
      "end_seconds": 103.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "And And what about weight loss, very heavy bleeding, pelvic pain or bleeding after sex?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.0,
      "end_seconds": 107.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.46,
      "end_seconds": 113.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "mm-hmm right, any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.6,
      "end_seconds": 118.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "okay, so bowels are regular, nothing odd"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.23,
      "end_seconds": 123.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.93,
      "end_seconds": 126.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.59,
      "end_seconds": 130.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.8,
      "end_seconds": 144.67,
      "duration_seconds": 12.87,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I've never touched a cigarette. I look after my grandchildren most days. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.72,
      "end_seconds": 148.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.43,
      "end_seconds": 153.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "I've had epilepsy for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.07,
      "end_seconds": 155.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.62,
      "end_seconds": 161.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "I have eczema, for about a year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.14,
      "end_seconds": 173.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.83,
      "end_seconds": 186.9,
      "duration_seconds": 11.07,
      "text": "Levetiracetam, 500 milligrams, twice a day for the seizures. Hydrocortisone cream, when needed. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.84,
      "end_seconds": 190.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "And for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.39,
      "end_seconds": 192.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "For two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.88,
      "end_seconds": 197.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "So, have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.48,
      "end_seconds": 205.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "I had a mole taken off my arm a few years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.66,
      "end_seconds": 227.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "what about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.43,
      "end_seconds": 230.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "My father has Parkinson's disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.39,
      "end_seconds": 236.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.01,
      "end_seconds": 246.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "okay, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.22,
      "end_seconds": 250.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.25,
      "end_seconds": 271.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal and the abdomen is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.61,
      "end_seconds": 280.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This is probably perimenopause."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.56,
      "end_seconds": 285.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.83,
      "end_seconds": 317.67,
      "duration_seconds": 29.84,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like perimenopause, but I'd like to confirm. I'd like to arrange a thyroid test for hot flushes. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I think a blood count makes sense here, for irregular periods. For this, estradiol gel, 1 pump, once a day, long term. That's for menopausal symptoms. Regular exercise, light layers and avoiding triggers can help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.0,
      "end_seconds": 325.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.81,
      "end_seconds": 333.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "So, I take the estradiol gel, 1 pump, once a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.42,
      "end_seconds": 341.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.37,
      "end_seconds": 344.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "thank you, that's helpful"
    }
  ]
}